// IntroString :
"P2501087660" "As you may know, the Face shops cater to some of the Rogue Isles most elite - and notorious - personalities. Longbow is constantly lurking about trying to nab some of my clientele, and I want to show those vigilantes they can't use our shops in this way! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take down some Longbow agents!</A>"
