"P2358064617" "I sent them an 'anonymous tip', so they should be along shortly. Teach those Longbow goody two-shoes to take their investigations elsewhere!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4019676165" "Has Longbow got the message yet? They have a base in Nerva Archipelago if you need to find more of them!"

